<title>UK: SBC sets warrants on Milan MIB 30 index.</title>
<headline>SBC sets warrants on Milan MIB 30 index.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss Bank Corp has issued 30 million American-style call and put warrants, in six equal tranches, on the Milan MIB 30 index, lead manager SBC Warburg said.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p> ONE WARRANT REFERS TO ONE SHARE OF THE UNDERLYING.</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	31.MAR.98		 PAYDATE	11.DEC.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   LONDON		    MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  15800 ITL</p>
<p>* * * * * *</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRIKE     ISSUE	 B/E PREMIUM   GERING</p>
<p> CALL	 15000 ITL  2390 ITL    10.1 PCT	6.61 X</p>
<p> CALL	 16000 ITL  1853 ITL    13.0 PCT	8.52 X</p>
<p> CALL	 17000 ITL  1414 ITL    16.5 PCT	11.2 X</p>
<p> PUT	  15000 ITL  875  ITL    11.9 PCT	18.1 X</p>
<p> PUT	  16000 ITL  1328 ITL    7.7  PCT	11.9 X</p>
<p> PUT	  17000 ITL  1891 ITL    4.6  PCT	8.36 X</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
